   "title": "你需要准备什么",
   "html": "<p>本地示范直接生成数据，不需要事故台账或传感器文件。以下清单是进一步开展真实数据研究时需要准备的材料，不能据此推断本项目已拥有现场数据。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>多通道钻井时序</span><span class='cl-s'>扭矩、立压、出入口流量等通道，按实际采样记录</span></span><span class='cl-n'>正常段充足即可，无需逐点标注</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>事故台账</span><span class='cl-s'>时间、类型、处理过程与复核结论</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于回放验证与报警规则标定</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>工况标签</span><span class='cl-s'>钻进、接单根、起下钻、划眼</span></span><span class='cl-n'>可由泵状态与钩载规则自动划分</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>传感器标定记录</span><span class='cl-s'>压力/流量计标定日期与量程</span></span><span class='cl-n'>剔除坏数据，防「传感器异常」误报</span></div></div>"
